_nc_ohc=q5FFYSZuzY0Q7kNvwG9nmpP&_nc_oc=AdqjiZnzYqQRylb6VD41Oo2ZIiPkhSOsrS7KUbntlJ6AsbTy0UJaspiqSmfKWu0evUg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCQcis9XMzDKljIDd31w9aOnKIK3JJLmbsPGpliWWgdxQ&oe=6A4A83C2"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot1.png", "id": "933082209784466", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/654854429_933082216451132_4347679212942506444_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hGedBEf9J98Q7kNvwEPDpYI&_nc_oc=Adp4DKTE262ezBOxyHC8taF-sfs8utzw5ZAsu_bhOyerqpDpNi1k1xB5eG0QsTQa3Co&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAo2b2CIUFEkCnGPJPgzytprXdi5ZKBPVIazUKn9E5meA&oe=6A4A7722"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Nolodin Download Manager", "keywords": ["download", "manager", "downloadmanager", "file", "browser"], "long_description": "Nolodin Download Manager is a VR-focused download manager for Meta Quest. It combines a built-in browser, a clean download queue, and practical file management tools in one interface designed for headset use.\n\nKey features:\n- Built-in browser for logging in and accessing download pages\n- Add downloads directly from links or supported browser flows\n- Resumable downloads with background transfer support\n- Live speed, progress, and remaining time indicators\n- Search, sorting, and multi-select actions in the download list\n- File manager for browsing folders and managing downloaded files\n- Download folder selection and cookie management in settings\n- English-first interface with support for additional languages\n\nThe app is built to make large downloads easier to handle in VR, with a clear interface, stable transfers, and controls that stay usable inside the headset.", "short_description": "A VR download manager for Quest with built-in browser login, resumable downloads, file management, sorting, search, and background transfer support."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://n